---
/* The one call to action on the site: sized and coloured like any other
   note about the thing above it — a step down the scale, a step down the
   grey ramp — so it reads as a remark rather than a banner. */
---

<p class="subscribe-note">
  You can subscribe to new posts on <a href="https://bschne.substack.com/">Substack</a>.
</p>

<style>
  .subscribe-note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .subscribe-note a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-text-quaternary);
  }

  .subscribe-note a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
